@startuml
title The `semantics` Clause and the Four NativeEval Forms
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
left to right direction

rectangle "An extender fragment\n<latex>\texttt{semantics}\;\langle \mathit{LanguageExpr} \rangle</latex>\n(optional; defaults to <latex>\texttt{Rust}</latex>)" as SEM #FDE68A

rectangle "A rule with a native body\n<latex>\texttt{Add . a:Int, b:Int |- a \"+\" b : Int}</latex>" as SRC #FEE2E2

rectangle "**(\"op\", name)** — declarative operator\nclosed algebra: add sub mul div mod neg\neq ne lt gt le ge and or xor not concat len\n**needs no semantics target**" as T0 #DCFCE7
rectangle "**(\"carrier\", kind, params)** — declarative literal\n<latex>\texttt{(\"carrier\", \"int\", \{ suffix : i32 \})}</latex>\n**needs no semantics target**" as T1 #DCFCE7
rectangle "**(\"handler\", urn)** — named capability\n<latex>\texttt{mtl:native:}\mathcal{F}\texttt{:Int\_PowInt}</latex>\nresolved against the node's registry" as T2 #FEF3C7
rectangle "**(\"src\", semantics, text)** — bootstrap escape\nsource text in the named semantics language" as T3 #FCA5A5

rectangle "<latex>\texttt{rho\_binop}</latex> / <latex>\texttt{rho\_unop}</latex>\n<latex>\rightarrow \texttt{rhoapi::Par}</latex> contract\n**already ignores the host body**" as OUT0 #BFDBFE
rectangle "<latex>\texttt{NativeKind}</latex> +\nframework literal parsers" as OUT1 #BFDBFE
rectangle "<latex>\texttt{NativeHandlerSpec}</latex>\n<latex>\texttt{Arc<dyn Fn(\&[GroundTerm]) \to Option<GroundTerm>>}</latex>\nchannel <latex>\texttt{[0xF1, }i\texttt{]}</latex>, body\\_ref <latex>\texttt{0xF100} + i</latex>" as OUT2 #BFDBFE
rectangle "<latex>\texttt{semantics = Rust}</latex>: project to <latex>\texttt{language!}</latex>,\nrequires a compiler at install time\n<latex>\texttt{semantics} \neq \texttt{Rust}</latex>: **fail-closed** today" as OUT3 #FCA5A5

SEM --> SRC : scopes the reading of every <latex>\texttt{![ … ]}</latex>

SRC --> T0 : 67 / 250 fold bodies
SRC --> T1 : 13 / 13 literal evals
SRC --> T2 : the long tail, by name
SRC --> T3 : verbatim migration of today's bodies

T0 --> OUT0
T1 --> OUT1
T2 --> OUT2
T3 --> OUT3

note bottom of OUT2 #FEF3C7
  **Unregistered URN <latex>\Rightarrow</latex> inert, never unsafe.**
  The evaluator yields <latex>\texttt{None}</latex> and the redex is left
  unreduced — the same fold-gate semantics as an
  arithmetic overflow or a non-value operand.
end note

note bottom of T0 #ECFDF5
  A specification whose every <latex>\texttt{NativeEval}</latex> avoids
  <latex>\texttt{(\"src\", …)}</latex> is **installation-pure**: elaborable and
  installable with no compiler in the loop.
  **28 of 31 shipped languages qualify.**
end note

legend right
  |= Color |= Status |
  |<#FDE68A> | The `semantics` clause (Stay) |
  |<#FEE2E2> | Host-embedding source, today |
  |<#DCFCE7> | Fully declarative — v1 |
  |<#FEF3C7> | Capability reference — v1; registry already exists |
  |<#BFDBFE> | Existing implementation, reached unchanged |
  |<#FCA5A5> | Requires a toolchain, or fails closed |
endlegend
@enduml
